---
import MainLayout from "@/layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="How It Works | NYCUNO"
  description="Learn how NYCUNO connects users with essential services through one convenient application."
  currentPage="How It Works"
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-site flex-1 px-4 py-12.5 sm:px-6">
    <section>
      <h1
        class="relative mb-7 pb-5 font-sans text-[35px] font-medium leading-none text-brand after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-[50px] after:bg-brand"
        data-reveal="up"
      >
        How It Works
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-base font-normal leading-[26px] text-[#404040]">
        <p data-reveal="up">
          nycuno functions as an integrated lifestyle platform, offering users
          a versatile range of services through a single, user-friendly
          application. Users can easily start by downloading the nycuno app
          and creating a personalized account. The application's intuitive
          interface allows users to explore and choose from a diverse set of
          essential services tailored to their daily needs, providing a
          seamless and convenient experience.
        </p>

        <p data-reveal="up">
          Upon selecting a service, nycuno employs advanced technology to
          efficiently connect users with various services as per their need.
          The platform prioritizes user satisfaction by incorporating features
          such as real-time tracking, secure payment options, and user reviews,
          ensuring a reliable and trustworthy experience. nycuno's commitment
          to user convenience is evident in its efforts to streamline processes
          and optimize the overall user journey.
        </p>

        <p data-reveal="up">
          With a focus on enhancing daily life, nycuno serves as a go-to
          solution for users seeking a comprehensive and efficient way to
          access essential services. The platform's all-encompassing approach
          reflects its dedication to simplifying the user experience and
          contributing to an improved and more convenient lifestyle.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
